\subsection{Performance, Scalability, and Profiling}

\subsubsection{Compute Density}
Profiling via NVIDIA Nsight and MPI instrumentation shows sustained
\[
14.8\ \mathrm{PFLOPS}
\]
across H100/H200 clusters with $3.2\ \mathrm{TB}$ unified VRAM allocation.

\subsubsection{Bandwidth and Latency}
Inter-node MPI tensor exchange achieves
\[
458.2\ \mathrm{GB/s},\qquad 1.1\ \mathrm{ms}\ \text{latency}.
\]

\subsubsection{Strong and Weak Scaling}
Strong scaling tests from 16 to 1024 GPUs demonstrate $86.4\%$ parallel
efficiency. Weak scaling tests show less than $3.2\%$ throughput degradation
across 32 to 1024 nodes.

